<title>USA: Northern States unit opens London office.</title>
<headline>Northern States unit opens London office.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>NRG Energy Inc, a unit of Northern States Power Co, said Thursday it opened an office in London to manage its increasing international business development.</p>
<p>It said Robert Brown was named managing director of the new office. Brown previously was head of power generation (international) for British Gas Plc.</p>
<p>NRG is engaged in electric power generation projects in the United States, Europe, the Pacific Rim and Latin America.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
